eate rare and exotic species. Combine slimes, nurture them, and be amazed by the delightful results..<br></li><li><i>Resource Management</i>: Efficiently manage resources to feed, please, and grow your slime population. Balance food, elemental resources, and space to turn your farm into a thriving haven.<br></li><li><i>Elemental Fountains</i>: Activate Elemental Fountains to attract specific slimes and speed up food growth. Each fountain enhances your farm with Fire, Water, Earth, or Nature energy.</li></ul><br><i>Slime Farm</i> is your gateway to an enchanting adventure of farming, where magic and cute slimes make every day extraordinary. Ready for the magic?","developers":["ANTENN"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910590/header.jpg?t=1731924496","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2910590/683037/b0ea1ccb861004426f9654fe971c7bc4de7067ea/1750888190/dash_av1.mpd?t=1713009070","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2910590/683037/b0ea1ccb861004426f9654fe971c7bc4de7067ea/1750888190/dash_h264.mpd?t=1713009070","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2910590/683037/b0ea1ccb861004426f9654fe971c7bc4de7067ea/1750888190/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1713009070","id":257013118,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257013118/movie480.mp4?t=1713009070","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257013118/movie_max.mp4?t=1713009070"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257013118/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1713009070","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257013118/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1713009070","max":"https://video.akama